< R SYSTEM SYSTEM LTYPES 4 I LT_CODE "" CABINET
< R SYSTEM SYSTEM LTYPES 5 I LT_CODE "" DRAWER
< R SYSTEM SYSTEM LTYPES 6 I LT_CODE "" BOX
< R SYSTEM SYSTEM LTYPES 7 I LT_CODE "" BIN
< R SYSTEM SYSTEM LTYPES 8 I LT_CODE "" BUCKET
< R SYSTEM SYSTEM USERS 1 I USER_ID "" 1
< R CONSOLE "" USERS 0 F USERNAME "" ?
< R CONSOLE "" USERS 1 F USERNAME "" ADMIN
< R CONSOLE ADMIN USERS 1 L "" "" ""
< R CONSOLE ADMIN USERS 1 W PWHASH "" ""
< R CONSOLE ADMIN LOCS 1 I LOC_ID "" 1
< R CONSOLE ADMIN LOCS 2 I LOC_ID "" 2
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 I ITEM_ID "" 1
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U MFR IBM Compaq
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U DESCR 1234567890123456789012345678901234567890 short
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U QTY 1 2
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 M LOC_ID 1 2
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U COND "" GD
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U WORKS ? N
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U TAGS "" Retro,isa,network,modern,abcdefghijkl,mn
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U NOTES "" MEMO
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 U NOTES MEMO MEMO
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 D "" "" DELETED
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 D "" DELETED ""
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 2 I ITEM_ID "" 2
< R CONSOLE ADMIN LOCS 2 U LTYPE BIN SHELF
< R CONSOLE ADMIN LOCS 2 U CAPACITY "" 5
< R CONSOLE ADMIN LOCS 2 U PARENT_ID 0 1
< R CONSOLE ADMIN LOCS 2 U NOTES "" MEMO
< R CONSOLE ADMIN ITEMS 1 M LOC_ID 2 1
< R CONSOLE ADMIN CATS 11 I CAT_CODE "" TAPE
< R CONSOLE ADMIN CATS 11 U SORTORD 50 7
< R CONSOLE ADMIN CATS 11 D "" "" DELETED
< R CONSOLE ADMIN CATS 12 I CAT_CODE "" TAPE
